The present value of a single cash flow received at the end of year 20 is  

\[
PV = \frac{50{,}000}{(1+0.04)^{20}}
     = \frac{50{,}000}{(1.04)^{20}}
     \approx \frac{50{,}000}{2.191123}
     \approx 22{,}800.
