The forward rate under interest‑rate parity is  

\[
F = S \times \frac{1+i_{CAD}}{1+i_{EUR}}
   = 1.4808 \times \frac{1+0.03}{1+0.04}
   = 1.4808 \times \frac{1.03}{1.04}
